<title>EGYPT: Eastern results at end-Q3 1996/7.</title>
<headline>Eastern results at end-Q3 1996/7.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are profit/loss accounts released by Eastern Company at the end of the third quarter of the financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1. All figures are in Egyptian pounds (comparative figures from the previous year in brackets where available):</p>
<p>Net sales			   355,695,000</p>
<p>Production costs		  295,571,000</p>
<p>Overheads			    15,084,000</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		 1,612,000</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses		6,123,000</p>
<p>Net profit/loss before tax    +40,529,000</p>
<p>($1 =3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1 jw</p>
</text>
